# Spoken lines are CSV keys in content/locales/strings.csv (es default, en column).
# Line tags honor_event / flag_set are IDs; DialogueBridge maps them to HonorService / EventBus.

~ start
Niño: _dev.smoke.child [#flag_set=smoke_seen]
Álvar: _dev.smoke.alvar
Cid: _dev.smoke.cid [#honor_event=burgos_camp_river]
=> END
